%% VoxFlow — documented call state machine (public contract)
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> greeting
    greeting --> identity_check: recording notice + ask for account factors
    identity_check --> identity_check: factors missing / mismatch (max 2)
    identity_check --> human_escalation: second mismatch
    identity_check --> intent_detection: identity bound to account

    intent_detection --> information_gathering: slot, status or reference missing
    information_gathering --> intent_detection: args supplied
    intent_detection --> policy_check: write or prohibited intent
    intent_detection --> tool_execution: read intent with complete args
    intent_detection --> human_escalation: two unrecognised intents
    intent_detection --> closure: caller ends call

    policy_check --> human_escalation: prohibited or out of policy
    policy_check --> information_gathering: PIN required
    policy_check --> tool_confirmation: low-risk or confirmed write

    tool_confirmation --> tool_execution: explicit yes, args hash matches
    tool_confirmation --> intent_detection: caller declines or changes order

    tool_execution --> result_validation: tool returned
    tool_execution --> human_escalation: timeout / termination / refusal
    result_validation --> closure: schema valid, speak from tool JSON
    result_validation --> human_escalation: malformed or missing fields

    human_escalation --> closure: callback ticket raised
    closure --> [*]
